 {'city':'Manchester','project':'Oxford Road / Cross City Bus Priority Package','priority':'Strongest UK multimodal and spillover measurement; bundled-policy evidence','treatment':{'moving_lane_conversion':'4.5km segregated on-carriageway cycle lanes plus1.6km bus/taxi/cycle-only section; general traffic excluded06:00-21:00; wider pavements; adjacent Upper Brook capacity expansion','scope':'Not a bike-only lane-conversion experiment','source':man,'sections':['2.4','5.4','5.9','7.3']},'timing':{'baseline_bus':'June2013','completion':'September2017 (full enforcement)','post_bus':'June2018','baseline_cycle':'March2015','post_cycle':'March2019','long_term':'through2023'},'observations':[{'metric':'cycle counts at four main Oxford Road sites','before':[772,1264,1799,1876],'after':[2580,3499,3922,4425],'unit':'cycles06:00-21:00 one survey day','table':'5.9','warning':'Do not sum as unique people/trips; sites can count same rider twice; no untreated cycle control'},{'metric':'MRI to city observed bus times seconds AM/interpeak/PM','before':[993,1075,1155],'after':[1154,1120,1330],'table':'4.6'},{'metric':'City to MRI observed bus times seconds AM/interpeak/PM','before':[1203,1213,1178],'after':[1221,1160,1165],'table':'4.9'},{'metric':'Upper Brook vs four radial roads journey-time index panel','years':[2013,2018,2019,2022,2023],'table':'5.13','description':'Measured GPS link times; comparators weighted by2013traffic volumes;24postyear-period comparisons reproduced'},{'metric':'Oxford Road yearly cycle counts','years':[2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023],'values':[929530,1054338,1076323,687590,858537,1100691,1257754],'table':'5.12'}], 'causal_design':'Before/after counts and observed bus times; adjacent-road GPS comparison versus four traffic-weighted radials. No randomization, no multi-period pre-trend test, no unit-level uncertainty. Through-trip estimates remove an assumed11-minute interchange allowance after new through-service; this is bundled transit benefit, not direct observed door-to-door panel.','limitations':['Does not establish total all-mode person throughput','Bus, access restrictions, speed limit30to20mph and signal changes simultaneous','Upper Brook capacity expanded deliberately; parallel road not untreated','Cycle/walk comparisons one day each; adjacent cycle surveys different seasons','Cycle site totals double-count riders','Source table4.10 PM percentage says−20%, but40:38to29:25 calculates−27.6%; calculations preserve rawtimes andflag discrepancy','Source table5.13 identical PM comparator series inbound/outbound; retain as published pending raw-data audit','Reportsection7.1 explicitly no full post-implementation appraisal due absent without-scheme highwaysmodel'], 'urls':[man,'https://tfgm.com/public-transport/bus/bus-priority-package','https://www.gov.uk/government/case-studies/building-cycle-infrastructure-in-manchester'],'files':['manchester_final_evaluation.docx','manchester_final_evaluation.txt','manchester_all_tables.json','manchester_bus_time_calculations.csv','manchester_parallel_road_calculations.csv']},
